  - "Counters live in a module-level __device__ buffer reset by the last departing CTA; a kernel aborted mid-flight would leave them dirty for the next call in the same process"
  - "Fallback rows run the slow r0 anchor"
measure_first: [H200]
compliance:
  single_stream: true
  no_cross_call_state: true
  fp32_math: true
  no_threads_or_fork: true
  no_precompiled_binaries: true
